    "en": {
     "text": "An even integer can be divided by 2 with no remainder. An odd integer leaves remainder 1. Look at the last digit: 0, 2, 4, 6 or 8 means even; otherwise odd. Zero is even. Consecutive even or odd integers differ by 2."
    }
